# Roadmap drops

When asked to process the roadmap, or when files appear in `docs/roadmap/inbox/`, follow
[docs/claude.roadmap.md](../../docs/claude.roadmap.md) exactly:

- Read the drop, `docs/PRODUCT.md` (freezes, non-goals), the owning doc, and the board first.
- Classify; create or update items with fixed prefixes (ENG / SES / TML / TRK / NAT / EXP).
- Every item has Why, Done when, Depends on, Client contract (capability + version), honest limits.
- Cross-repo work: server item here + a handoff in `docs/roadmap/outbox/`. Never write into a client repo.
- Move processed drops to `docs/roadmap/accepted/` with a processing note; update `docs/roadmap/README.md`.
- Commit and merge roadmap work via PR when required CI is green (never bypass); no implementation or release rituals unless the person asks.
- Docs you touch meet `docs/DOCS_STYLE.md`.
